    {
      "question": "e-5560",
      "field": null,
      "attribute": "question/problem",
      "old_sha256": "0ab2763953aa668d2c9fd559b8bc3c541dbb83abb3a7affde7d0b5f3053fe8b0",
      "new_sha256": "bded27aa5f5f379101205022255160a3c03bc4e0e30582d323743bfd67444ecb",
      "category": "ma_capture",
      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-5560",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "For the vector ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065672/assets/b85705767814eae0f99345888b1f0c65a89dbbc76458d7093a02a20937d2e1c3.png) which of the following statements are true?\n\n- $\\mathbf{u}$ is orthogonal to the set ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065672/assets/85cd8d0ebcd70de93ec2bd5007907a02d81daadd27b348e7c72ccef53654d881.png)\n\n- $\\mathbf{u}$ is orthogonal to the set ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14065672/assets/e03fd2577b8d7067f4507d0ee6fe732d3786a494134cd967d3c65de01e28e709.png)",
          "category": "ma_capture",
